              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Make sure we’ve got as many ticket booth staff as possible and have the Flex Team overlap their shift 15 minutes early (10:45 AM) so the line doesn’t spill over to the water taxis.</run>
