            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Peak off-season demand rarely exceeds 25 passengers per hour.</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Recommendation: Operate with a baseline skeleton crew (1 POS operator, standard vessel crew) to minimize unnecessary labor costs.</run>
            </formatted-text>
