              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Near-zero demand before 8:00 AM and after 8:00 PM. Permanent staff hours scheduled during these windows should be officially redirected to vessel maintenance, deep-cleaning, and cross-training.</run>
